---
import Arrow from './Arrow.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---
<section class="hero container" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <p class="location"><span class="status-dot"></span> San Francisco, by way of Lagos & Canada</p>
  <h1 id="hero-title">Hi, I’m <span class="hero-name">Saheed<span class="hello-dot">.</span></span><span class="sr-only"> Akinbile</span></h1>
  <p class="hero-description">Founder, engineer, and entrepreneur.<br />Putting my love of AI to work as co-founder & CTO of <a href={profile.minicor} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Minicor</a>.</p>
  <p class="hero-aside">I love things that move, and the software that makes them work. I also build businesses in agriculture.</p>
  <div class="hero-bottom"><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="#work">What I’m building <Arrow /></a><a class="quiet-link" href="#about">A little about me <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div><a class="hero-yc" href={profile.yc} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span class="yc-mark">Y</span><span>Y Combinator <b>Spring ’26</b></span><Arrow diagonal /></a></div>
</section>
